message: "If you use this software or derived data, please cite the arXiv preprint (preferred) and this repository as below."
type: software
title: "Palisades Urban Wildfire GeoAI: replication code"
authors:
  - family-names: Farajpoor
    given-names: Parastoo
    affiliation: "Department of Biological and Agricultural Engineering, University of California, Davis"
  - family-names: Narimani
    given-names: Mohammadreza
    email: mnarimani@ucdavis.edu
    affiliation: "Department of Biological and Agricultural Engineering, University of California, Davis"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-22"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MohammadrezaNarimaniUCDavis/Palisades_Urban_Wildfire_GeoAI"
abstract: >-
  Public replication package for a spatially validated GeoAI analysis of
  structure destruction during the January 2025 Palisades Fire, linking CAL FIRE
  DINS inspections to pre-fire Sentinel-2 vegetation amount/moisture, Landsat
  temperature, LANDFIRE fuels, terrain, and dated OpenStreetMap building
  arrangement under random and 1 km spatial-block cross-validation.
keywords:
  - urban wildfire
  - structure loss
  - GeoAI
  - spatial cross-validation
  - Sentinel-2
  - Palisades Fire
  - building density
  - vegetation moisture

